  project:{title:"Contributions across civilizations",brief:"Create an evidence chart for Sumer, Akkad, Babylon, Assyria and Persia.",steps:["Locate each civilization and identify one contribution.","Explain how an object or text provides evidence for that contribution.","Show one connection to later societies without claiming a single origin for all civilization."],criteria:["correct locations","specific evidence","recognition of cultural exchange"]},
